// Existing K1-K21, Pullback, Phase-1/Phase-2 and prior causal Human Entry payload remain untouched.
// Dataset: raw/audited XAUUSD; 2004 warm-up only; OOS 2012-2026; no synthetic candles / no gap interpolation.
// Validation discipline: same 878 K1 M15 source events; no predictor/filter change; no future candle may create a source signal.
